{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114193","id":3117187430,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc65zIFm","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114193","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114193.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114193.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114193","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114193/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114193/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114193/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5e8078fa4bb1f480b6bccaf332a6ef5d2e5453f1","number":114193,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix `PhysicalBone2D` abnormally restoring `body_mode` in `_ready`","user":{"login":"Yanxiyimengya","id":140093497,"node_id":"U_kgDOCFmoOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140093497?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya","html_url":"https://github.com/Yanxiyimengya","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yanxiyimengya/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"We found that during the constructor phase of the physical skeleton, the following method is used to deactivate the rigid body.\r\n`\r\nPhysicsServer2D::get_singleton()->body_set_mode(get_rid(), PhysicsServer2D::BodyMode::BODY_MODE_STATIC);\r\n`\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ef34c3d534a16b140aef0643ed2fa36f8e9d1612/scene/2d/physics/physical_bone_2d.cpp#L289-L296\r\n\r\nBut this approach has serious flaws. \r\n**This behavior will cause the 2D physics skeleton to completely fail.**\r\n\r\nBecause this method modifies the physics mode of the rigid body through PhysicsServer2D, bypassing the set_body_mode method of CollisionObject2D.\r\n\r\nSubsequently, PhysicalBone2D attempts to restore physics mode during the Ready phase : \r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ef34c3d534a16b140aef0643ed2fa36f8e9d1612/scene/2d/physics/physical_bone_2d.cpp#L49-L66\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ef34c3d534a16b140aef0643ed2fa36f8e9d1612/scene/2d/physics/physical_bone_2d.cpp#L150-L168\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/40cf5a0f50b4ddbd1d6990c7e7b92226665d7053/scene/2d/physics/rigid_body_2d.cpp#L261-L276\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/40cf5a0f50b4ddbd1d6990c7e7b92226665d7053/scene/2d/physics/collision_object_2d.cpp#L552-L566\r\n\r\nThe key point is: we modify the physics mode through PhysicsServer, while the CollisionBody2D property `body_mode` still defaults to `BODY_MODE_RIGID`, which causes `body_mode == p_mode` to be true, preventing PhysicalBone2D from correctly restoring its initial rigid body state.\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/78367*","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5796,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:35:07Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-12-19T10:42:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T19:06:53Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_